      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:besa.thieving.monbba",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲫⲏ ⲅⲁⲣ ⲉⲧⲉⲛϥⲟⲩⲃⲏⲛ ⲁⲛ ⲁϥϯ ⲉϫⲱ**ⲛ** .",
